window.poems = [{"id":"t.0","title":"12 things i hate about you","lines":["I hate the way you lied and said you wanted me","And i hate the way you made me laugh ","And i specially hate that you were the first boy that ever made me cry ","And i hate that i ever saw something with you","And i hate the way you you loved her and not me ","And i hate that you didn’t even made the effort to do so","And i hate that i was so attached to you ","And i hate that you didn’t even ever tried again ","And i hate that one unanswered call was all it took you to stop existing in my life","And i hate you a little more when you said we were never nothing ","And i hate that i miss you when you are not around anymore ","And i hate the way your pictures still makes me smile","And most of all ; i hate the way i don’t hate you at all,  not even a little bit , not even at all"],"tabs":["t.0"]},{"id":"t.acwk0lymy15c","title":"Back To You","lines":["So we made a deal","Where he breaks my heart once","I fix it","I Give him a chance ","he breaks it again","And I don’t even try to mend it this time ","In that lavender haze ","No I love the bittersweet sting every time ","When i see him waiting on his phone again and again","Wishing he could be mine","We are there every time ","We so close yet far away in different worlds ","And I can’t understand why is he so different to me than to the world ","Because all i hear is “ he is not for you “","And they are certainly right ","Because two stubborn souls can never be together ","But that burning gaze , cut throat banters ","leaves me high and alone ","And i cut it with booze","One shot down ","He is all i can see","Another shot down","His lips move in a cinematic timing","Yet Another shot down","Only air pass through us ","One more shot down","And im all bared in front of him","He sees through the lies i tell ","And the things i hide in the dark","And i hate him and love him at the same time","The classic push and pull","So cliche right ","Yet i never find my happily ever after"],"tabs":["t.acwk0lymy15c"]},{"id":"t.6q47sdfzeq1m","title":"Being in love is an art","lines":["Oh didn't you realized ","I strangled my heart on this thin thread just above your favorite sword","hoping that you won't slice it into pleces","Because when you told","I was an art","And I said I was a choas","Ya, I funcking masterpiece, you replied ","I believed you !","But I didn’t knew you were good at making everyone laugh ","I was no special","You didn't played around heart","It just who you were","Painting a illustration around everyone","But I found myself lost into maze ","Hoping I don't find my way back","But \"I ain't no special to your heart”","- Bhhummi"],"tabs":["t.6q47sdfzeq1m"]},{"id":"t.h5mwytw7jpqp","title":"Bunch of liars ","lines":["They don’t know but nightmares are parts of dreams ","there is nothing in the world just good everything has something bad underneath it .","This is the world of yin and yang the classic blend ","The greys which we are the best examples and with us it’s just gets more shady","There is no such good or bad souls we all are just bunch of pretty liars who try to be worthy to fit in this world ","To be worthy it take a a lot ,trust me I have being there and we pretend ;","We pretend to be be good souls hiding our lies under our selves ","We pretend to be bad souls trying to protect our lies under the blanket where we fight our demons ","Confining hiding protecting we tend to forget that for whom we are doing all this , are bunch of liars themselves ","they pretend it or not ","And then deep in our hearts we all knew our lies ","And we knew what our hearts wants ","Is nothing but a plain simple mundane truth that was covered under the glorified heap’s lies ","Our emotions are simple but this twisted brains makes it complicated because easy is never fun ! "],"tabs":["t.h5mwytw7jpqp"]},{"id":"t.kes6cmv19lpr","title":"Burning home","lines":["I know how it is to be brought up in a burning home","Where no one wants to put the fire off","Yet continue build it","And when you offer them a solution ","They shut you up because they know it all ","And oh kids should stay away from fire","Yet welcome another one in the house","A house yes not home","Because home never smells of ashes","They tend to forget burning house is not for kids","Because they were too busy fighting the great war of their remains of their love","And yet again refused to seek help when offered to put the fire off","All way forgetting they still have a kid at home and another one in their arms","They protected the one in their arm","But what about the one in the house","She felt the burns","Burns so deep that she will never will be same little girl who offer to put the fire off","The war continued and now the fire was a blaze  ","Now they built a new place that will never be home again for the one burnt but a home for the one in their arms","And little good girl now searches for home in every place she visits ","Realizes No place will a home again ","Now it wont matter even if the war ends","She will forever hold the blaze within her","And watch that blaze slowly and steadily burn every progress she tries to think","To think not even initiate ","No one will never know how it is to be in the burning home","All they know is she is cold clever and fierce","But they will never know the kid with ","Warm heart blabby smile and innocence ","She is still there ","She survived the fire but it also killed some pieces of her unknown to the world","Because the know it all hides it perfectly ","Alas she was brought up in a burning home","Who never knows how is it to be home ","But thrives on the idea to be home someday. "],"tabs":["t.kes6cmv19lpr"]},{"id":"t.vvvn7jkkzl3y","title":"Can you just love me?","lines":["When i wanted him to see my eyes and smile","Him eye’s casted dowm to the swell of my chest ","When i wanted him to notice the kindness in me ","All he saw was the curves i hid under the cover","When i wanted him to fall for my smile","All he did was stared at my lips only with one intention ","I know when i gave in it was consensual ","And now i crave for more","It was causal","And i don’t blame him","But now when his hands are on my body ","It makes my skin crawl ","The disguist fills up my chest","The anxiety makes me want to hid somewhere unknown to both of us","Now the pleasure is nothing but a way to degrade my self worth into ashes of humiliation ","And my reflection is just a dirty, strained, and gross image I can’t see anymore ","The lust that grew between us now scumbs into tears in my eyes","For the love i can’t t never have","You needed my body and never wanted me ","And with everything between and beyond ","The lust will never be love ","And he can never love me ,like i want"],"tabs":["t.vvvn7jkkzl3y"]},{"id":"t.fbkel8q0jkph","title":"Do you miss us ?","lines":["Will you ever miss us?","Because sometimes in the middle of  night","I think of you ","How your hands crassed my thighs ","And those messy top lip kisses that turned in much more","So much more that I couldn’t handle it","My mind was a lavender haze","The hollow pit in my stomach ","That butterfly eruption took over my soul","That i stopped you yet craved for more","The maroon covered my cheecks and moles","Under my old sweatshirt ","It was a hidden randavouz ","And you said you like it that way","Does it makes me wise or bad","Because the morning sound was pleasant yet rust grew on the telephone ","And in my head it was so much more than we are right now","Because i long for your trysts ","But maybe the stars didn’t align and fate wasn’t by my side","I was left alone with my sheets ablazed with the thought of you ","Forever holding the secret of us in my heart ","Wondering if you regret us ?","But maybe stars knew I deserve more ","And fate taught me to love me ","More than you could ever love me."],"tabs":["t.fbkel8q0jkph"]},{"id":"t.1axu5onp2itz","title":"Forever and a day ","lines":["I like watching the stars disappearing in nothingness with the rising rays ","I makes me believe that nothing gonna last forever no matter how perfect it is ","But also it doesn’t mean thats what comes next is any less pretty","Just like that memories are seldom ","Those are good to hold on to but there are some we need to let go but remember the lesson they taught ","Just like all things truly wicked starts from  innocence ","Broken minds cant be mended","To show them the lights one must endure the burning ","Because the marks they leave are often too scars","And these scars had a telltale nobody wants to listen ","And it brings numbness and hardship along","And then its not screams but the silence that become your best friend ","There was a time then when i hate myself for being me ","The world is full of suffering but it is also full of overcoming it i heard ","So I didn’t needed someone to pull me out of the abyss life throw me in , i just needed someone to hold my hand and say its just gonna be okay someday","And I didn’t need anyone to fix me , i just wanted  someone to tell me I could do it much better myself ","And then love came alongs as a elixir of life ","Causing both hurting and healing "," I was the most alive in it","And it changed me for bad ","Into someone whom i didn’t recognize in mirror ","But loving him became my favorite thing ","And habits are hard to let go specially the bad ones","But like always it important to remember when to let go","And now suddenly seeing stars didn’t make me dream anymore ","And sunlight didn’t smelled of hope","Alas in end i was just a mere human drunk on the idea of love ","That love and only love can heal my brokenness","Because grief at its worst was unreal","So i became a reason i can feel seen , heard, welcomed, loved , valued and supported.","At last I was lost in love with myself ","I saw a glimpse of my own paradise ","Free as a wind as i give myself wings to fly","I felt I could stay by side by myself ","In love forever and day "],"tabs":["t.1axu5onp2itz"]},{"id":"t.c0xd6nw97r9u","title":"Hold me Close","lines":["I had no problem with provocative ","We were in for a ride that night","The breeze felt like your arms when they touched my body ","I was so cool , but then you saw me ","And I burn for you , for you to hold me close","You wouldn’t look me in eye ","Yet keep dropping hints for the unseen ","The night got me close to you","But all we did was talk ,that was first ","And you would keep bantering ","Just to get a reaction out of me","The chemicals override","I wanted to call you mine ","But i will break my heart all over again","Just to have you close to me again","And i was up all night","Yearning for you to hold me close","But that made me think ","It is fate or miracle or conventional ","Wondered what if you regretted ","The secret us ","That it feels so right yet wrong","Because what if i mess it up","Would we’ll be alright ?","I stayed by the phone that night","Waiting for a sign","And heard my glass heart break again","But the thought of you holding me close","Makes it all right"],"tabs":["t.c0xd6nw97r9u"]},{"id":"t.3x9ccgf3jd3r","title":"I don’t think love is made for me","lines":["Now hole burns in heart ","Thinking was everything just a phase for you","That you passed on so quickly ","And I’m the only one holding down the last bits of shred memories that i couldn’t forget ","Was all that a fleeting moment you craved cause you wanted someone to hold you grounded cause all now remains is dust on my heart and phone","They say give it 3 months you will pass it","But how do i explain how much everything meant to me ","Cause you not just another guy to me you were someone my special ","And i never regretted anything more ","But i wish i would have said how much you meant to me ","And i guess i will always live it ","And i wish i could move past it as easily as you did ","Cause you replaced me so easily like i wasn’t even there ","And now thinking about someone feels like im cheating on you","But we were  never anything real","But somewhere something gave me hope to find a home in you","And now i stare at those “ i love you ‘s “ and wished i would have said it back","And i wish i would have picked up that last call","Stared at your face a little more and heard you voice a little longer and engraved it in ","my heart ","And now 3 months later everything feels like fading but memories come back stronger then ever ","And now I couldn’t remember the times i cursed you i just remember how you made me laugh ","And i couldn’t remember how much you frustrated me","I just remember how much fun our banters were","And i wish we could go back to the old ways but we don’t talk anymore and you forgot all about me","Cause now when the summer hits me again ","I will be a year older and you won’t tease me about it and i will still wait as the clock hits 12 to see my heart break all over again cause i know you wouldn’t miss me the way i do","And nevertheless it wouldn’t matter how much we talked about the “invisible string theory ”, we weren’t lucky enough to have the “last meeting one ”","And there is so much i haven’t said to you ","But now i think its for better ","Cause i would not survive more flashbacks and echos","And i tell myself , now its time to let go","But moving on from you feels impossible and it burns a hole deeper in my heart ","And now only the flames remain and i will still wait for you to come back and write another “i love you ” in that burning red till it turns into ashes; ","Ashes i would happily inhale if it meant to hold on the remains of you a little longer even when my lungs give up and my heart stops beating ","Cause you always will be my golden boy shining bright like the daylight at the end of the night"],"tabs":["t.3x9ccgf3jd3r"]},{"id":"t.apv6yfctf9a3","title":"Just a phase","lines":["A lot happened in a month or so","Had a lot of firsts","Disappointed myself ","Partied away all the feelings ","Talked to strangers ","But didn’t pour the whiskey","Justified all the wrongs","Did the exact opposite of what i was supposed to do","Lied through the teeth and bones","And i know what is right and wrong ","But the heart doesn’t support the moral","And all i want is to up the noise around me ","So I don’t have to think about what they said and obviously did","And all i do rot in bed and doom-scroll the thoughts aways","Sink my potential in water","And rebel me says its teenage petulance ","So who the Fuck make them understand that 18 is not adulthood ","Alas the world doesn’t revolve around me ","Fuck it because anyways I can’t have anything i want"," "],"tabs":["t.apv6yfctf9a3"]},{"id":"t.v3jstu6t9i3k","title":"Just like a best friend ","lines":["Remember the monster we were afraid of when we were young ","Cause it used to linger in night ","Dark . Quite . Dreading ","Now is my best friend ","Consuming . Overwhelming. Hollow ","Love how it sucks all the goodness with one single thought ","No matter how much you fight it ","It always comes back like a best friend ","Love how even when everyone around you love you’s","It always taunts you ","“You are never enough “ ","“ You will die alone”","“ You are not worth it “ ","“ Why do you even exist “ ","“ I have hundreds more options “","just like the best friend!","And you are always taken for granted ","And no matter strong you come off","Its always over your shoulders to remind you ","That you are always replaceable ","You are no one’s favorite ","God forbid a priority ","Just like a best friend ","And when you try to block it out ","And makes you feel","Numb. Shut . Detached","Hopeless. Weak. Devastated ","But then comes a day where they bring you the ","Star. Moon . Sun","Flowers. Breath of Fresh Air . Cake ","Just like a best friend","But as they say","Life is full circle ","And you are zero and it fills you with","Nothingness. Void . Traumas","Just like a best friend"],"tabs":["t.v3jstu6t9i3k"]},{"id":"t.liq4pfj3h0ax","title":"Life is Romantic Right?","lines":["There so much art and beauty you haven’t see cause you refused to leave","Cause you were born in a city and decided to never leave","You called it home","There is so much void and grief you haven’t experienced cause you settled down","Cause you have someone to go home to","But what if that home haunts you ","Cause someone who was once home was dead , gone and buried ","Then why do you are still hanging on to those ashes that weren’t yours to keep","Like breathing those ashes gives you smell of home "],"tabs":["t.liq4pfj3h0ax","t.h12zgwhxlv8d"]},{"id":"t.m0dx4w3c0iyq","title":"Love again ¿","lines":["Across the room ","You whispered “ Have we met “","The quirky conversation in the secrecy","The lingering touches in the darkened room","Slow moment that kept me up","And everyone in room were keeping up with the rumors ","I was wonder-stuck blushing way back home ","Listening enchanted on loop","You Kept me occupied all the night ","And I could still smell you on my clothes ","And that makes me so furious ","Because you make me feel that way ","Fast forward to the days when something kept you up that wasn’t me ","And now I spend forever wondering ","If you know how special it was for me ","There hundreds of moments I created in my head knowing all along ","You were leaving too soon","And i knew that night was the time when the story began and eneded ","Yet i kept waiting for you ","Stumbling back to home to my books alone ","Because you didn’t want to come along "],"tabs":["t.m0dx4w3c0iyq"]},{"id":"t.wf1abp217kqc","title":"Love and Lies","lines":["Both love and lie starts with a L ","And we know what are we good at ","That’s definitely not love , but lying in love we are the experts ","We don’t feel an ounce of guilt before getting naked but getting naked with feelings thats where we suck the most ","So if i see , lovers are the best liars ","And You know what else starts with L , loser ","So basically all love does to you is make you lie to someone you love and make you the biggest loser "],"tabs":["t.wf1abp217kqc"]},{"id":"t.6srhxpb7ltvw","title":"Love and poetry ","lines":["When Its all fair in love and poetry ","Then how can my love be mediocre","Its ought to be deep passionate and have fibers of me","You play it cool , what are you in high school?","I don’t romanticize you leaving me stranded ","So Love me like the poets loves their muse","Because i know you have reserved a place for me in your heart","But you only breaks whats your favorite ","And for loving you i not ruining my life","So remember i not letting you break my castles","And no i not gonna fix you","Because once i fix myself you gonna miss me ","And your are not gonna get me back","No matter how much i long for you","No matter how much i love you","Not even when my hearts tortures me","Because i write my poetry myself ","And you can’t defeat the alchemy ","So go sit in the corner and think","How did it all end?","But fuck it i was so in love","That i changed my poetry for you","I tried saving our sinking ship","But for what ","Just for you to leave me stranded again and find someone else","Oh tragedy ! ","I hate it here ","Yet once again I’m down bad crying for you ","But I’m not even allowed to cry","So how much sad did you think i had in me to hide ","And i still waiting for clue of remains of my love ","Because I chose you so religiously ","Now all i see are visions ","And i am now mad and wretched ","Because ruining my cosmic love is all you did ","So fuck you if i cant have you","I will change my typewriter ","And rewrite my manuscript and change the alchemy ","Because its all fair in war and poetry ."],"tabs":["t.6srhxpb7ltvw"]},{"id":"t.s2je8dej0z8y","title":"Love Cocktail","lines":["The crowded room","They know nothing about us","We both were more than what they know about us","Swaying your bodies as we both drunk","When we were electrified ","And i knew in a heartbeat I shouldn’t fantasize you","But my cheeks were scarlet ","It knew it damn well ","I would be wasted like a champagne ","Yet i gave in like bottle of a rosé when you asked","I knew that 3 am walk back home wasn’t worth the while yet I savored it like the martini ","My hands were shaking from holding you back","Because thought you were like beer ","Better with time and long to stay ","But then realized you are the tequila ","3 shots down and my vulnerability is out in open","And you will be a corner with someone else ","having fun at my expensive ","I knew my heart was the worst liar and should have stayed away when i first got to know you ","Yet it saw the truth in you ","You said my name and my heart craved more for you ","And i was drunk on your love","And for me it was always you never someone else "],"tabs":["t.s2je8dej0z8y"]},{"id":"t.3li87q6uz0n7","title":"Love cursed ","lines":["We were so tragic ","Why’d you go away ","for the heck of it","I craved my heart out for you ","And you just laid those flowers like it was a death bed","Now how do I fall out of love ","now how do I be in love again ","That room in my heart still have those empty frames that screams your name ","Веcause now that little thing call love is forever bejeweled ","For as long as love I know my forever will fall apart","And you will never think about Me","Now for the rest of Me.","There's no way I could ever forget you."],"tabs":["t.3li87q6uz0n7"]},{"id":"t.y3jytpnwktu3","title":"Love I remember ","lines":["I didn’t notice when the drizzle changed into thunders ","I didn’t notice when I was left alone in an unknown street ","Because till the time I remember you are always there,beside me holding an umbrella ","confining me in your warmth "," I didn’t notice when place beside me on that swing on which we crave the our name with a heart ","broke, and i was all alone ","because till, I remember you were there ","swinging me back-and-forth ","Till my giggles echoed in the space","then twirling me in your arms in our bubble ","But I  realized","that it was our bubble ","And maybe not our ","it was my happy bubble ;  A fuvking mirage ","where we were one ","but as they say Mirage is mere illusion ","We were also a delusion of mine","And just like that ","I knew that some happily ever after don’t exist. They are just some bunch of happy people together for time being ","And some are happy alone ever after ","And for some there is no more a forever to hold on","And that too just maybe ."],"tabs":["t.y3jytpnwktu3"]},{"id":"t.n7xfo5dloy7","title":"Love is for fools","lines":["Why do i always have to be your option ","Never i a choose","Why do i always fill the void created by others","Never fit like a puzzel ","In the story of life","I gave all , all i had ","And you didn’t felt that i was even worth the footnotes in the story of your life","Was everything we had was in my head","And you tolerated me for sake of it","I wish we were in a wonderland ","Where i was your daydream","Not a nightmare you wished wasn’t there","I wish you celebrated me","But you just beared me ","And i bared my soul to you ","Just for you make a mockery of it","For you ,you made me the joker of crowd ","And that’s when i played my ace","I was everything i never was","Fast forward to today","I have paid the price for every little stunt i pulled","And you closed the chapter ","So I burnt the book ","And now you want me back","When i am thousand miles away","So distant that even for your presence doesn’t affects me","But i can never me that i was with you"],"tabs":["t.n7xfo5dloy7"]},{"id":"t.uzn58gaf105g","title":"Love me Again","lines":["I fell in in love with the moments we had together ","Cause you drew me in like how silk attracts fire and it just melts in it","There was nothing provocative ","But with all the chaos around ","We somehow found a safespace just to be us","And like clockwork i was there again holding back my pieces so that i dont give them to you","I was just enchanted ","And you were the enigma ","Because finally i met someone who was just my type","But life just loves me too much ","To not to throw a fuvk you on my face","So you had to be someone’s else ","But i will be forever hold you in my memories ","because when i taught i nothing than a scored prize ","You made me believe in love again","Made me realize love can be about shared thoughts , filling each other’s silence and most of all ","Someone can love me just because its me ","and it doesn’t have to come with conditions applied ","It can be unconditional , giving and makes your heart dance .","That i don’t have to settle for mediocre and "],"tabs":["t.uzn58gaf105g"]},{"id":"t.jc0zumlr8288","title":"Love me better","lines":["I was the mastermind ","But you played the ace","The stars aligned that midnight morning ","And fate played its game","But so much for a play","And you weren’t even mine to lose","So never mind ","I won’t wait for your love ","And we could have seized it all","Only if you had been good to me","But you never good at games","Alas now even stars align ","We will forever star crossed lovers ","Nah strangers who knew each other too well","And disappeared with the morning that came."],"tabs":["t.jc0zumlr8288"]},{"id":"t.q6d3f7p3yhkr","title":"Love not enough ","lines":["You give me butterflies ","but wasn't being in love gives you","peace","You make laugh","but wasnt being in love makes me fall in love with your silence","You mesmerized me","but wasn't being in love make you fall for disenchanting versions of mine","You finding a home with me ","but wasn’t being in love makes you seek home in me","You were there for time being","but won't being in love makes you","Stay For ever.","You ware my farfetched dream maybe that's why love was just not enough","- bhhummi"],"tabs":["t.q6d3f7p3yhkr"]},{"id":"t.8377mpxsdpta","title":"Love that never spoke","lines":["The pain of losing you never got any less","The love i had for you never got any less","The desire to have you never got any less","The hopeless romantic in me never got enough of you ","The heart of mine never got over you","For all those wondrous time ","And all chains around my demons ","Tied me with that golden chain of love","That held you to me with those invisible string","I crossed my heart won’t tell a soul about you","But i still got love for you","Because you lead me on","And whispered your love in the dark ","Next day i hide my scarlet letters","And told myself i thought i don’t recall your face","Because all you had to do was stay, but you didn’t ","But love that lasted so long ","Long that i love you to the moon and Saturn","But my fears followed all the way","And i wanted you to know i tired ","But i made you regret me ","And your not saying you are in love with me","But in my wildest dreams i thought you are going to be","Alas i paid the price for it","I wanted to be your endgame ","Maybe thats why i cant have nice things ","I would have stay forever if you just said don’t go","But for that you have to stay too","Now that we don’t even talk any more","And everything has changed ","This is the last timing i asking you , begging again","To leave a last message ","But like forever and always ","I guess its a goodbye again","But till this day ","I remember the story of us ","The each tingle on my skin","Like its was yesterday ","And our last kiss never ended even when our breaths felt short","But I forgot this wasn’t a fairytale ","Then i saw castle of my dream crumbling down","And i was the Queen and you player the Joker on me","It opened my eyes and thereafter I realized stories are sweeter in fiction ","And I learned the hard way ","You have to forgive but never forget ","Now I don’t wanna live a forever in your memories ","But when i am with him","I feel like I’m cheating on you !","And Its just a question ","Do you feel the same way?"],"tabs":["t.8377mpxsdpta"]},{"id":"t.8cc7gbj3s1gg","title":"Love that was never mine","lines":["The night in secrecy","Under the warmth of blankets","The way he creased my thigh was only known to me","The labored breaths ","We were so close yet so far","I longed for the trysts ","But what if its just all in my head","What if the fantasies were the idea of you","that i was drunk on","The pulse of my heart almost dropped when your hand left mind","All i know is that it was terrible of you to haunt me so stunningly ","And this teenage petulance is gonna cost me almost everything ","Yet just the idea of you makes me choose you religious","Was i wise or mad thinking i had you ","All of you just for me forever ","For all i know","I can always just have the idea of you ","Not you","All i wish you were never not mine ","But never mind you were never mine","Now all through i’m long for you as always ","I’m just long for you ."],"tabs":["t.8cc7gbj3s1gg"]},{"id":"t.uvg2gssfd4qz","title":"Love was never a need","lines":["In the uncomfortness of the touches","I felt your presence ","I read you through your soul","Who said intimacy was about physical touch ","It was all about ","Longing stares","Unspoken words","Comforting silence ","Touches made me hate myself ","But you touched me through words","Your kindness ","Your generosity ","Your empathy ","And for someone ,touches were scared ","I was longing for them ","Because it was you ","And all I wanted was you","But you thought i needed you","And when love becomes a need ","You are left with shredds of the remains of the most beautiful feeling in this world ","And to be loved !","Oh to be in love again !","I have to be myself again with the remains of you "],"tabs":["t.uvg2gssfd4qz","t.yak420byxjjg"]},{"id":"t.27bvrdl91ak7","title":"Love with you ?","lines":["What difference it would have make if ","You realized i didn’t a need friend","I needed you , your everything ","I wanted us to be together ","I wanted lovers hug , Not a friend embrace ","I wanted a kiss that could numb everything in me","I wanted a cuddle that could relive every fiber in my soul ","I didn’t needed the fraction  you ","I wanted the whole ,i always just wanted you","I wanted you to love me even with your hand tied","Because I didn’t loved you in black or white for me it was always red ","I always enjoyed our ride back home ","But couldn’t you be my home ","Was it too much to ask even after everything ","Couldn’t you be just mine ."],"tabs":["t.27bvrdl91ak7"]},{"id":"t.uj403jtr6fz0","title":"Loved you","lines":["Now i look back ","And suddenly all my silence is the chaos ","I’m the paradox I taught people about ","So passionate but emotionally shut","Happy but i find my muse in sadness","Say I’m happy alone but I’m starving for love","I starving for that someone to hold me through my silence ","Just for everything to make sense","And now when i am knee deep in hell","I hear you comeback in echos","And everything is so loud","I couldn’t hear myself ","I just burn on the nostalgia ","That was so sweet to savor ","But i guess it was never love ","Or it was","And love was just not enough ","I starved in that longing ","I starved for you","Cause i kept you in my heart ","But i was not even worth your footnotes ","And all i want is go back to the night we meet","And undone everything ","Cause i had all of you","And now i have none of you ","And terror stills makes my heart cold ","Wish i could tell you the truth, instead i said my goodbyes ","And now our paths cross and your just a stranger whose laugh i would never forget ."],"tabs":["t.uj403jtr6fz0"]},{"id":"t.ne9t46qdpcez","title":"Scars to your Beautiful ","lines":["Words did die when she unveiled herself","Glitters did die when she encountered hope","Moments did die when she reminisced memories","Colours did die when the grey scattered","She did die when those broken fragments of herself maimed her","But for the war that broke","A queen as such she was, fierce and brave with a heart of gold","She streaked as a ray of dawn And did what colours did to grey ","Just what veracity did to falsehood ","And what light does to gloom","And she was the one who survived her scars! "],"tabs":["t.ne9t46qdpcez"]},{"id":"t.i2zf7itcvspg","title":"She live in the dreams","lines":["Im not surface level as you think","Just because i blabber alot","Doesn’t mean i don’t have depth ","I have depths larger than oceans","But as the ocean tries to reach the shore but they never stay together for long","I try to tell convey each and every thought in my mind ","But sometimes even when my heart and mind synchronizes my tongue has a mind of its own ","I try to tell you so much ","But again there is a string of useless words that i blabber in front of you","And then i play it dumb all way knowing the truth and the braids of lies woven by me and even you","I wish someday i meet someone ","Who will sit and listen to my each and every word like its the holy bible","Who knows the depth’s of my thoughts ","Who doesn’t think to be the man you have to be rude and egoistic ","Someone who is sweet and kind and respectful ","Someone for whom i would matter and not just a prize he scored ","Someone doesn’t mind me having high standards , for god sake even me being high maintenance ","because he understands i’m just setting my boundaries ","Oh to be with a Prince Charming in this real world ","Girl you actually think shit!!"],"tabs":["t.i2zf7itcvspg"]},{"id":"t.rw85x9eukxe0","title":"The Demons inside ","lines":["In the closet of our mind ","The demons hide safe and dark","And lurk around like wandering thoughts ","And when the nights gets darker they come to consume you","And they dont consume you at once","They consume like poison ","First the heart beats too fast","The breath become short","The chest feels heavy ","Because the weight you carried ","The weight of thoughts becomes a burden on your shoulders ","And the night only gets darker from here","And you try to search for light ","Only to realize its a far fetched dream ","Then finally the demons consumed you wholly","That even the darkest night looks like a dawn ","And you live with it like its your brother","Only for you to realize no matter how much it had consumed you it can never be new normal you thought of","And when the stars and moon disappear and there is no sound around to distract you","The demons come back stronger and bigger","Only to push you in that never ending maze ","Where you are nobody who can never be good enough ","Where nobody is there to hold you when you fall deeper ","And when they are done with you ","There nothing left except the shatters of blood around and the numbness that comes along ","The nonchalant actions accompany its","And then everyone just hates you ","And it doesn’t matter if you alive ","Because you are dead from inside ","Add nobody wants to be there for someone who isn’t lively ","So you let the demons finally take you somewhere from where you can’t come back","And painlessly die. "],"tabs":["t.rw85x9eukxe0"]},{"id":"t.q7h8strnou7z","title":"The last cigarette ","lines":["Light. Burn. Drag.","That’s how a cigarette is smoked,","but doesn’t love happen the same way?","Spark. Burn. Yearn.","Both kill you and make you feel alive","at the exact same moment.","I didn’t even smoke before you,","but sharing a cigarette became","a love language of our own.","I might not have kissed you,","but I inhaled the same smoke as you—","when you passed it to me","while holding my hand.","The ember burns my fingers","like I burn for you.","And as the tobacco turns to ash,","I tap the heat away—","the same way I must let you go","so I don’t choke on this love.","Now, holding on to you feels like holding","the very last cigarette in the pack.","A sweet addiction that betrays you in the end.","So as I light this final one,","I burn away my urge to hold on.","I crush the glowing tip into the ashtray ","the same way I crush my own heart—","so it never falls for you again,","hooked on the same sweet addiction.","I let you go","as I let the smoke rise.","I wrap myself in the comfort of the haze","to hide my tears,","just as I clung to you","until I was strong enough to say goodbye."],"tabs":["t.q7h8strnou7z"]},{"id":"t.3abm3a2dsu0","title":"The last time","lines":["Maybe one last time ","I don’t know what I expected ","But maybe one last time ","You call, your message hits my screen and those butterflies would explode in the pit of my stomach ","But for that one last time","I didn’t knew i had to let those butterflies eat away my heart so nothing flutters anymore ","And maybe one last time i wish i don’t question myself every second ","How did knowing me more made you like me less","Maybe this was the last time i felt i was lovable and queen in game of chess you played so slavishly ","But i forgot the last time and should have known better that i will always be the pawn","Just filling up the space for someone else","And you kept digging deeper inside to fill up that space and i willingly let you","cause i thought you would see the constellation in the darkness of that may ; ","i hide so well","But maybe i should have learned from the last time ","That darkness make people run to the west where the sun doesn’t rise ","And the last time i hoped that this time things would be different and you would want more me soon as we left the sheets","But while remembering the freckles in your eyes and i didn’t realize when the shine in my eyes left ","And the last time i still regret not keeping my eyes on you cause you were gone in the blink","So for the last time ","I think i will close my eyes hoping to remember you in the fondest memory as Orion’s belt thats shines in my eye .","~ Bhhummi "],"tabs":["t.3abm3a2dsu0"]},{"id":"t.r2ouzhbc8v65","title":"The secret of us!","lines":["The last summer is hard to Forget ","Too much happened too soon","Over the moon in expectation ","I shared a vulnerable moment with you","Won’t say i like you but I don’t even hate you","Because the signs you gave were never clear","The scarlet letters you left on my nightstand ","I always reach out in the fleeting moment ","And I don’t wanna get you back","But say you got someone","I will get someone new too","I’m vicious and poisoned in way","And i know and you feel it like a old joke","But we aren’t even talking","The history is clear , flame always burns up in ashes ","The hearse of chemical in my body burns for you","And it felt like invisible string theory turned into “what the hell i do?”","The night your were taking profits and margins","I was by my nightstand with false prophets ","Shamelessly by my phone for a sign","But the if history clears, it always ends up in ruins ","Wonder if you regret the secret of us ?"],"tabs":["t.r2ouzhbc8v65"]},{"id":"t.5yf3yaqxsktg","title":"The silence was the Answer ","lines":["Wasn’t i worth holding onto anymore ","Was always your option never a choice ","Now i stand hereby watched the sunset ","Lost . Hopeless. Numb","And now it gone , was it worth ?","Maybe . Yes . Not Anymore ","Every one around said love yourself ","And it all come back to you","I did but for what","For you to never see me again ","And now i stand in fields of green","Waiting. Dreading. Crying ","Asking you to love me","Cause I’m tired of everything around ","Im not strong as i show","All i want is the cocoon of false security i had ","For you to become the solitude to my chaos ","So that we can sail in ocean through the sunset ","Until our next eclipse ","And talk how beautiful the moon is ","But i was your star right ","Many of thousands ","Nothing special to remember by","But how do I explain ","That you were my sun","The center of my universe ","But I forgot that you can burn me ","Cause i was so in love","Alas here I’m ","Burned. Dejected. Emotionally Shut","And now i sit by the ocean all alone","Staring and thinking ","The ocean is so beautiful isn’t it ?","And answer comes yes","So i guess its finally over","There was good in that goodbye ","And no more hurting myself for that fraction of us","I known i deserved better ","I guess that why i walked away ","But how do i fill this hole in heart and stitch it  ","Cause the simple truth is ","I LOVED YOU TO THE MOON AND SATURN","Just for you to hang the moon and star for someone else","But till it ends","You will never know that you were my favorite aurora borealis "],"tabs":["t.5yf3yaqxsktg"]},{"id":"t.yqewezvzaksd","title":"When in love","lines":["If all of it is over then why do i cry when i mention your name in my mundane conversation","If is was never meant to be then why did we ever meet","I knew it was love then why did you never called it what it was","We were always in loop , so what happened to our invisible string that tied us","Funny how you only loved her , and I only love you","And i was even ready for the fractions of you and yet you didn’t had the courage to love the whole of me","Everything was just too much or maybe i was just not enough ","I don’t know why i spilled my guts to you knowing you are gonna sell it to others like gossip","And now i confine all the hurt i have into my heart where it drills a hole no one seems to fill up","And cry myself to sleep cause all the lies you told were my truths","And nothing is same ","You are not person the i loved","I am the person i hate","I am everything i promised myself i will never be","So you were the poison which i drank anyways cause when in love you die the same death every day"],"tabs":["t.yqewezvzaksd","t.exzz8gm3sp8k"]},{"id":"t.qktosgzdiuxz","title":"You and I but never us !","lines":["It felt just like a joke right","What a shame!","Now you can’t even look me in the eye straight ","Past that night","When your eyes bore into mine","And that scandalous randevous ","Where our souls bleed","Oh just mine not yours ","It was an ego boost , a distraction right ","And I don’t know what to call it now","Its so messy ","And i feel like a paradox ","I burn for you yet feel cold when you are close","The eagerness to see you is like heaven yet i hid from your sight","Because those burning gaze reminds me of hell","Was it a miracle or a heresy that i gave in so easily ","Knowing it all , how we are gonna end up","Because i knew all the hints you dropped on the way yet i pretended to know nothing ","Knowing for sure i was the mastermind ","Of that miracle or heresy you know","Whatever it was, was incomparable ","So fuck you ","The chemical ultraviolet overide left ","you and me ","that will never be us !","And its all a joke now ?"],"tabs":["t.qktosgzdiuxz"]}];
